abstract: >-
  Exploratory fabric simulation, a finite-buffer network model, a numerical
  CPU mixture-of-experts inference prototype, a bounded transport reference,
  synthesizable RTL and a physical-measurement validation harness. Synthetic
  software and RTL simulation results do not establish physical hardware
  performance, full-system energy efficiency or manufacturing feasibility.
